Maintainer: fehlix <fehlix@mxlinux.org>
Changed-By: fehlix <fehlix@mxlinux.org>
Description:
 mx-updater - tray applet to notify of system and application updates
Changes:
 mx-updater (26.10.01mx25) mx; urgency=medium
 .
   * Terminal: fix xdotool window search failing to match the terminal
     title on qterminal by quoting it with bash's ${T@Q} instead of
     printf '%q'.
   * Terminal: when a terminal manages its own geometry ("own" size
     option), skip only those calls to adjust the size and position.
   * roxterm: set window class explicitly.
   * terminator: fix a stray quoting bug in the --icon argument.
   * Actions: force debconf to noninteractive during upgrades, instead
     of leaving it to try (and fail) to init a GUI frontend under
     pkexec; drops the "debconf: unable to initialize frontend"
     warnings. Removed the now-unused desktop-session/Qt-theme
     environment passthrough (DESKTOP_SESSION, KDE_FULL_SESSION,
     XDG_CURRENT_DESKTOP, QT_*) that existed only to support that GUI
     frontend.
   * Translations refresh.
